@startuml
title The Smallest Agent - Aspire / MAUI / .NET 10 / C# Messages SDK
autonumber
actor "Student / Client" as Browser
participant "MAUI / shared Razor client" as UI
participant "ASP.NET Core endpoints / C# service" as API
participant "Anthropic C# SDK" as SDK
participant "Claude API" as Claude
Browser -> UI: Run agent(prompt)
UI -> API: POST /api/agent/stream
alt Valid prompt and configured key
  API -> API: Validate; tools disabled
  API -> SDK: CreateStreaming(parameters)
  SDK -> Claude: Prompt; no tools
  Claude --> SDK: Model response
  loop Each text delta
    SDK --> API: Safe text delta (projected by service)
    API --> UI: SSE message event
    UI --> Browser: Update typed state (native or server)
  end
  alt Final result received
    SDK --> API: ResultMessage fields (normalized by service)
    API --> UI: SSE ResultMessage
    UI --> Browser: Render answer + metrics
    API --> UI: SSE done event
  else SDK failure or missing final result
    API --> UI: SSE error; no done
    UI --> Browser: Error + snackbar
  end
else Missing key or invalid prompt
  API --> UI: Key: SSE error / input: 422
end
@enduml
